{"_id":"zN2JTBAZ4vdHMbjx","name":"Rim Encounters","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","description":"<p>Roll 1d100 (00-99) for a random encounter on the Rim.</p>","formula":"1d100-1","replacement":true,"displayRoll":true,"results":[{"_id":"ojVoEpb8dvSJQtRA","type":0,"text":"An old friend. They have a job for you.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[0,0],"drawn":false},{"_id":"m2JUT6fGmHLZ3I4g","type":0,"text":"A gutter punk smoking. Hand stitched jacket: \"punch corpos\".","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[1,3],"drawn":false},{"_id":"nIS4uhl9XRBsxBZx","type":0,"text":"1d5 Long haulers on a break.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[4,6],"drawn":false},{"_id":"ffhn67N2SrbaSY47","type":0,"text":"A jumpbreaker pilot, alien stars in their eyes.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[7,9],"drawn":false},{"_id":"3pa72nDrH7bqlaHK","type":0,"text":"Two evangelists of a fringe religion. They press a flier (real paper, homemade) into your hands.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[10,12],"drawn":false},{"_id":"NCGuAIVxphIObQ70","type":0,"text":"A bounty hunter checking a portable terminal. C:55 Pulse Rifle 3d10 DMG or Net Gun. I:35 AP:7 W:3.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[13,15],"drawn":false},{"_id":"ULsvYaywpnhJ4sKw","type":0,"text":"2d10 rowdy miners on leave, black encrusted hands. C:25 fists 1d5 DMG. I:25 W:2.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[16,19],"drawn":false},{"_id":"y3LXq4VyPGR19S0B","type":0,"text":"Uptight corpo agent trying not to look like a corpo agent.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[20,23],"drawn":false},{"_id":"5BggxlKRGLYn0ffa","type":0,"text":"4d10 new colonists, eager and naive.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[24,27],"drawn":false},{"_id":"pbQ6380NXqy9tyFA","type":0,"text":"Scientific expedition team readying for a mission. One scientist, two assistants, two rangers (C:50 Pulse Rifle 3d10 DMG or Tranq Rifle 1d5 DMG. I:45 W:2).","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[28,31],"drawn":false},{"_id":"sVXYdhpwEcfMnuAt","type":0,"text":"Smuggler in a battered flight jacket chatting up a customer.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[32,35],"drawn":false},{"_id":"rpcBXIDv7EQn0HLt","type":0,"text":"A nervous woman with a shaved head. In a blink she disappears.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[36,39],"drawn":false},{"_id":"AdtyPXCuWJaxcE3B","type":0,"text":"A dealer leaning nonchalantly. Two goons nearby. C:30 Revolver 1d10+1 DMG. I:20 W:2.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[40,43],"drawn":false},{"_id":"2dTd6eDbbkcFSJwm","type":0,"text":"1d5+1 Pirates. C:40 Overcharged SMG 2d10[+] DMG. I:20 AP:3 W:3.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[44,47],"drawn":false},{"_id":"wdoyq306hgrsHhij","type":0,"text":"A talkative academic going on about alien runes. An enormous silent bodyguard endures the torrent of information. C:35 Handgun 1d10 DMG or brass knuckles 1d5 DMG. I:25 AP:3 W:3.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[48,51],"drawn":false},{"_id":"ec7JThVyKKgYof5Z","type":0,"text":"1d10 Resistance forces, cloaked in tattered beige robes. C:40 SMG 2d10 DMG. I:30 AP:5 W:2.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[52,55],"drawn":false},{"_id":"jCs1HkTLl1EBLYVP","type":0,"text":"A Synthetic Liberation Front android spray painting a complex symbol on a wall. Viewing it triggers a Sanity save in humans. Underneath: \"Built but not owned.\"","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[56,59],"drawn":false},{"_id":"dwMeUB7N6kMRyYPR","type":0,"text":"1d5 Street urchins, curious, cajoling, begging. 50% chance they attempt to pickpocket you.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[60,63],"drawn":false},{"_id":"gwZZYLOGSiImwdjg","type":0,"text":"Three robot work crew, welding enormous steel plates back into place.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[64,67],"drawn":false},{"_id":"DKX7rULuceWwwg8Q","type":0,"text":"Chainbroken Android astronavigator looking for work.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[68,71],"drawn":false},{"_id":"pLcqoppPvfmCZkyc","type":0,"text":"Beggar, head bowed, hands cupped outward.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[72,75],"drawn":false},{"_id":"1r9tpfUVFmeTVeIF","type":0,"text":"Vendor on a blanket selling bootleg holos.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[76,78],"drawn":false},{"_id":"bRPFIUleG3pO3gAG","type":0,"text":"1d5 human and android sex workers.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[79,82],"drawn":false},{"_id":"9mMBNUtC8PODvGWT","type":0,"text":"3d10 singing festival goers adorned in brightly colored flowing cloth.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[83,85],"drawn":false},{"_id":"82VuUg8sFmIaDOlq","type":0,"text":"Two body modification extremists with heavily augmented sleeves.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[86,88],"drawn":false},{"_id":"TcgE1t3EMaRZbcQj","type":0,"text":"Rim ship crew drowning their bonus pay.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[89,91],"drawn":false},{"_id":"WG73R6k0dcAYh4ey","type":0,"text":"1d5 void nomads looking to hitch a ride.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[92,94],"drawn":false},{"_id":"4KyUCKZ83XtLIC3i","type":0,"text":"Retiree asleep on a bench, legs kicked up on a suitcase.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[95,96],"drawn":false},{"_id":"IRkAsK9JQCyTsHun","type":0,"text":"Corpo assessor looking for potential expansion properties to purchase.","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[97,98],"drawn":false},{"_id":"5Rbuf6UA4noBJO54","type":0,"text":"An Emissary (Fear save).","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","weight":1,"range":[99,99],"drawn":false}],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"mosh","systemVersion":"0.4.0","coreVersion":"11.308","createdTime":1685936572185,"modifiedTime":1693515520278,"lastModifiedBy":"6EeM38DJkcBWNAmw"}}
